=Assign each chunk in the user message to the single best-fitting theme. Use the exact chunk_id from the list and a theme_id from the themes below. Use NONE when no theme fits. Return exactly one assignment per chunk.

Themes:
{{ $json.batch[0].output.themes.map(t => t.theme_id + ": " + t.name + " - " + t.description).join("\n") }}

